{"id":"wb-3-13","name":"茅盾故居","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:40+00:00","status":"ready","title":"乌镇茅盾故居","text":"乌镇茅盾故居位于浙江省桐乡市乌镇东区观前街19号的茅盾故居，是茅盾出生和生活的地方，也是茅盾进行早期创作的地方。\n\n茅盾故居是一幢面宽四间前后两进的两层木构架清式民居，面积约450平方米。故居南临观前街，西临修真观，东临立志书院。1985年，在对故居修复后，辟为茅盾故居，向公众开放。1988年1月13日，中国国务院确定为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B9%8C%E9%95%87%E8%8C%85%E7%9B%BE%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85","revisionId":93000946,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93000946","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/a50ac1ca527237af7269e218.jpg","title":"乌镇茅盾故居,_2026-03-21_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%B9%8C%E9%95%87%E8%8C%85%E7%9B%BE%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85,_2026-03-21_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/14/%E4%B9%8C%E9%95%87%E8%8C%85%E7%9B%BE%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85%2C_2026-03-21_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​乌镇茅盾故居","width":320,"height":214},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}